            "detailed_description": "<strong>Gravilon</strong> is an inventive, thought-provoking puzzle platformer.  <br><br>Use powerups in each environment, and your own inherent gravity-bending powers, to complete each level.  <br><br>The levels and game mechanics are designed to encourage exploration and to allow for creative pathfinding — there is no one correct path for most levels, there is only (arguably) the fastest, most efficient route.<br><br>Gravilon's story unfolds in the background. The level design builds on itself so that the more you play, the more you will learn about your role in the world.",
